      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to see more customizability for the UI update and the good news is that it's already planned with the upcoming 'Launch Pad' menu. Check out how \"Wings\" will be implemented: https://youtu.be/QBQnCxtDaso?t=2573\nPer Technobabel during the April dev stream, they're releasing parts of the UI update in chunks so that it's easier to fix bugs, and accept feedback.",
