  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-04T16:26:47.517Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There should be the ability to adjust the look and feel of the VRChat Menu (Like maybe in the menu update) you should be able to change things like menu color button positions and maybe the ability to add shortcuts to other options. Also another idea would be to add the ability to make custom addons (Not a client) for the menu that you can add to a folder or something. Having the ability to blur the background of the menu and other things would be really nice too.",
